  "$comment": "The trees (crates/art/nature/src/trees, built by cargo art): the G5 garden trees, the woods' oaks, maples, birches, pines and spruces, and the potted lemon tree. Listed in the base manifest's packs. Leaves are on `foliage` and trunks on `bark`, which the nature shader sways and tints. Each has a far version (`far`), which the far woods and the town overview draw. Clips: an apple shrinks away while it is picked, the fruit follows the tree's ripeness (picked bare, the lemons all go), the Japanese maple's stray sprigs while it is shaped.",
